# Body Atlas Models — ignore rules
#
# This repository holds code, notebooks and documents. It never holds medical
# data, patient images, or trained weights. Datasets are fetched by each user
# under that dataset's own licence and terms; weights are published as release
# artefacts once their training data's licence has been checked (CATALOGUE.md).

# --- Datasets and medical images -----------------------------------------
# Most datasets in the catalogue forbid redistribution, and some are behind a
# signed data use agreement. A single committed file can breach that licence
# and cannot be removed from history once pushed.
data/
datasets/
raw/
*.dcm
*.dicom
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.nrrd
*.mha
*.mhd
*.raw
*.svs
*.ndpi
*.mrxs
*.tif
*.tiff
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npz
*.npy
*.zarr/
*.parquet
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z

# --- Trained weights and exported models ---------------------------------
# Weights inherit the constraints of the data they were trained on. They are
# released deliberately, never committed.
weights/
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.gguf
# Any other binary export is caught by the pre-commit hook, which refuses
# binary files outside docs/figures/png/ whatever their extension.

# --- Training runs and experiment trackers -------------------------------
runs/
outputs/
logs/
lightning_logs/
wandb/
mlruns/
tensorboard/

# --- Notebooks -----------------------------------------------------------
# Notebooks are tracked; their autosave directory is not.
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Python --------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/
wheels/
.eggs/

# --- Environments --------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version
.conda/

# --- Test and tooling caches ---------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.cache/
.huggingface/
.kaggle/
kaggle.json

# --- Secrets -------------------------------------------------------------
# Kaggle, PhysioNet, Synapse and Hugging Face tokens will exist locally once
# notebooks start fetching data. Never here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Editors and OS ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# --- Fonts ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Lora and Poppins are fetched locally for the figures, not redistributed.
docs/fonts/

# --- Private research layer ----------------------------------------------
# Research method, organ descriptions and dataset curation stay local. The
# public side is CATALOGUE.md, an index. The pre-commit hook refuses these
# paths even when forced with `git add -f`.
RESEARCH-PROTOCOL.md
research/
thoughtprocess.md
private/
